<DocsLayout lang="en" title="YAML reference" description="The basic Shumoku YAML document shape.">
  <h1>YAML reference</h1>
  <p>A topology contains nodes, links, optional subgraphs, and render settings.</p>
  <pre><code>{`name: Branch network
nodes:
  - id: router
    label: Router
    type: router
  - id: switch
    label: Access switch
    type: l2-switch
links:
  - from: router
    to: switch`}</code></pre>
  <p>
    This representative page is handwritten for Phase 1. The full reference will be generated from
    code by future SSG-independent tooling.
  </p>
